---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy and enquiries" description="How Blackline Development handles information entered into the current public website contact form and enquiries sent by email.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
        <h1>Control what you send.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">The current website lets you prepare an enquiry. It does not silently submit a form or create a customer account.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 850px">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Current public website</p>
          <h2 id="privacy-heading">Privacy and enquiry information</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-list">
        <article class="process-step">
          <div class="process-copy">
            <h3>Preparing an enquiry</h3>
            <p>Our commission enquiry form runs in your browser. Selecting “Prepare email” opens a draft in your own email application for you to review. The website does not automatically send or store what you type into that form.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step">
          <div class="process-copy">
            <h3>If you choose to send an email</h3>
            <p>Sending an email is a separate step you control. The message and your email address will be processed by the email services involved in delivery and by Blackline Development to read and respond to your enquiry. Do not include passwords, API keys, bank details or sensitive documents in an initial enquiry.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step">
          <div class="process-copy">
            <h3>Analytics and accounts</h3>
            <p>This version of the public website does not use a visitor analytics integration or provide website user accounts. Technical hosting and email providers may still process data needed to deliver their services.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="process-step">
          <div class="process-copy">
            <h3>Questions and data requests</h3>
            <p>Contact <a class="inline-link" href="mailto:support@blacklinedevelopment.uk?subject=Privacy%20enquiry">support@blacklinedevelopment.uk</a> to ask how a submitted enquiry is handled, including requests to access or correct information, or to ask about retention or deletion. We will review requests subject to any applicable legal obligations.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-copy">This notice describes the current website and email-enquiry flow. Commissioned client systems and future account or payment features require their own appropriate privacy information when implemented.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
